WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.933
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>HI, THANKS FOR MAKING TIME. CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.067
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>YES, ALL GOOD.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.067
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>SO, ABOUT LORCAN THORNBURY.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:14.400
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>RIGHT. LORCAN HAS BEEN STRUGGLING SINCE THE MOVE TO SALTCOAST.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.533
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>WE'RE CONSIDERING A PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENT PLAN AND POSSIBLY TERMINATION.

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:24.467
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>OKAY. THEIR SALARY IS $22 MILLION, RIGHT?

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.733
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>YES, PLUS A 17.5% BONUS TARGET.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:31.267
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>AND AURELIO CORDOVA WOULD BACKFILL?

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:36.933
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>POSSIBLY. DON'T MENTION THE RESTRUCTURING OF THE QUORVANE TEAM YET.

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.867
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>UNDERSTOOD.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:44.600
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>SEND NOTES TO TEODOR_ODUYA@THORNQUIST.EXAMPLE, NOT THE SHARED INBOX.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.733
<v HAMZA JABLONSKI>WILL DO. HAVE A GOOD WEEKEND.

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:49.467
<v MIRELA QUINTERO>YOU TOO.
